{{!-- Velocity/Movement Panel --}}
<div class="velocity-panel">
  <h2>Ship Movement</h2>

  <div class="velocity-controls">
    {{!-- Current Velocity Display --}}
    <div class="velocity-display-large">
      <div class="velocity-main">
        <span class="velocity-number">{{spelljammer.velocity.current}}</span>
        <span class="velocity-unit">ft/round</span>
      </div>
      <div class="direction-display">
        <div class="compass">
          {{#each directions as |dir|}}
            <span class="compass-point {{#if (sjEq dir ../spelljammer.velocity.direction)}}active{{/if}}"
                  data-direction="{{dir}}">{{dir}}</span>
          {{/each}}
        </div>
        <select class="direction-select">
          {{#each directions as |dir|}}
            <option value="{{dir}}" {{#if (sjEq dir ../spelljammer.velocity.direction)}}selected{{/if}}>{{dir}}</option>
          {{/each}}
        </select>
      </div>
    </div>

    {{!-- Movement Limits --}}
    <div class="movement-limits">
      <div class="limit-box">
        <span class="limit-label">Max Acceleration</span>
        <span class="limit-value">{{spelljammer.velocity.maxAcceleration}} ft</span>
      </div>
      <div class="limit-box">
        <span class="limit-label">Max Deceleration</span>
        <span class="limit-value">{{spelljammer.velocity.maxDeceleration}} ft</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {{!-- Velocity Adjustment Buttons --}}
    <div class="velocity-buttons">
      <h3>Adjust Velocity</h3>
      <div class="button-row">
        <button type="button" class="velocity-adjust" data-adjust="-200">-200</button>
        <button type="button" class="velocity-adjust" data-adjust="-100">-100</button>
        <button type="button" class="velocity-adjust" data-adjust="-50">-50</button>
        <button type="button" class="velocity-adjust" data-adjust="50">+50</button>
        <button type="button" class="velocity-adjust" data-adjust="100">+100</button>
        <button type="button" class="velocity-adjust" data-adjust="200">+200</button>
      </div>
      <div class="button-row">
        <button type="button" class="velocity-adjust danger" data-adjust="{{sjMul spelljammer.velocity.current -1}}">
          <i class="fas fa-stop"></i> Full Stop
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {{!-- Helmsman Actions --}}
  <div class="helmsman-actions">
    <h3>Helmsman Special Actions</h3>

    <div class="action-card overdrive">
      <h4><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i> Overdrive</h4>
      <p>Triple your maximum acceleration. Requires WIS (Vehicles) check based on speed.</p>
      <button type="button" class="helmsman-action" data-action="overdrive"
              {{#unless spelljammer.crew.helmsman}}disabled{{/unless}}>
        Activate Overdrive
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="action-card brake">
      <h4><i class="fas fa-stop-circle"></i> Emergency Brake</h4>
      <p>Triple your maximum deceleration. Failure causes 2d6 force damage to ship.</p>
      <button type="button" class="helmsman-action" data-action="brake"
              {{#unless spelljammer.crew.helmsman}}disabled{{/unless}}>
        Emergency Brake
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="action-card evade">
      <h4><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i> Evade (1st-level slot)</h4>
      <p>Add proficiency bonus to AC or Vehicle checks until next turn. +2 per level above 1st.</p>
      <button type="button" class="helmsman-action" data-action="evade"
              {{#unless spelljammer.crew.helmsman}}disabled{{/unless}}>
        Evade
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="action-card jamming">
      <h4><i class="fas fa-satellite-dish"></i> Jamming (3rd-level slot)</h4>
      <p>Match another ship's speed, acceleration, and deceleration for 1 minute.</p>
      <button type="button" class="helmsman-action" data-action="jamming"
              {{#unless spelljammer.crew.helmsman}}disabled{{/unless}}>
        Initiate Jamming
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  {{!-- Overdrive DC Table --}}
  <div class="dc-table">
    <h3>Overdrive/Emergency Brake DC</h3>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Current Speed</th>
          <th>DC</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr class="{{#if (sjLte spelljammer.velocity.current 100)}}current{{/if}}">
          <td>0-100 ft</td>
          <td>0</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="{{#if (sjGt spelljammer.velocity.current 100)}}{{#if (sjLte spelljammer.velocity.current 300)}}current{{/if}}{{/if}}">
          <td>200-300 ft</td>
          <td>5</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="{{#if (sjGt spelljammer.velocity.current 300)}}{{#if (sjLte spelljammer.velocity.current 500)}}current{{/if}}{{/if}}">
          <td>400-500 ft</td>
          <td>10</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="{{#if (sjGt spelljammer.velocity.current 500)}}{{#if (sjLte spelljammer.velocity.current 700)}}current{{/if}}{{/if}}">
          <td>600-700 ft</td>
          <td>15</td>
        </tr>
        <tr class="{{#if (sjGt spelljammer.velocity.current 700)}}current{{/if}}">
          <td>800-900 ft</td>
          <td>20</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  {{!-- Collision Info --}}
  <div class="collision-info">
    <h3>Collision Damage</h3>
    <p>When ships collide, both take damage based on ship size:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Fighter (0.5x0.5):</strong> 1d10</li>
      <li><strong>Sloop/Schooner (1x1):</strong> 2d10</li>
      <li><strong>Frigate (2x2):</strong> 3d10</li>
      <li><strong>Heavy Frigate (3x3):</strong> 4d10</li>
      <li><strong>Ship of the Line (4x4):</strong> 5d10</li>
    </ul>
    <p><strong>Grazing:</strong> If only clipping a corner, Helmsman can make WIS (Vehicles) check to avoid damage.</p>
  </div>
</div>
